reason: Lacci's clear returns nil, not the slot (ledger row requested)
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $slot = stack { para "Old text" }
  @go = button("Go") { $returned = $slot.clear { para "Brand new text" } }
end
----------- test code
button("@go").trigger_click
assert_same $slot, $returned, "clear { } returns self"
